{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0064_1000_p", "source_sha256": "1131ab2bb23947facc0620b738fae90e2e3511a8edb4d72a31d33e83927cca51", "ja": "（春香のPV撮影が順調に進んでいる。これなら\nスケジュール通り、いいものになりそうだ！）", "zh": "（春香的PV拍摄非常顺利。\n这下应该能照着行程安排，拍出不错的成品！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0064_1001_001har", "source_sha256": "d0cdb28f6c0eb9ff1c08c6c7ef1be871b6f532014dc9fa8219d296a526b030ca", "ja": "ふう……。\n{$P$}さん、お疲れさまです～。", "zh": "呼……\n{$P$}先生，你辛苦了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0064_1002_p", "source_sha256": "d24bdcb75295780dcc9630e271e807ff33443e26b27c01d5ad7057f0d9837fda", "ja": "お疲れさま、春香！　さすがにスムーズだな。\nカメラの前でも、緊張してなかったみたいだし。", "zh": "辛苦了，春香！拍摄过程非常顺利呢。\n你面对镜头好像也都不会紧张。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0064_1003_001har", "source_sha256": "76905ad3c3cca2d4e348870459ac33d0e0e6773a568785ed7a7b3d7defa09736", "ja": "そ、そんなことありませんよ！？　私、すっごく\n緊張して、ず～っとガチガチだったんですから……。", "zh": "才、才没有这回事呢！？\n我其实超级紧张，动作一～直都好生硬……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0064_1004_p", "source_sha256": "9fe55799c91460e9f0f2240a16ec7d44c34bf5b417b0ad61a54141fd2534bf15", "ja": "あれ、そうだったのか？　監督ともすごく自然で、\nいい絵が撮れたって話をしてたんだが……。", "zh": "咦？是这样吗？导演也说你表现得非常自然，\n拍到了很不错的画面耶……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0064_1005_001har", "source_sha256": "a67eebd2ab44e4b12746c2dcd9d6b57d945e8ceff69d1b934e6c13b55cdb1bd8", "ja": "えっ？　あれ？\nそんなはずないって思いますけど……？", "zh": "咦？怪了？\n我想应该不可能啊……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0064_1006_p", "source_sha256": "22e4a1c11b480eee1ada48bad2e1ddee4f523a09034f74efd3b1d8eecfec8ece", "ja": "せっかくだから、一緒に映像を確認してみるか。\nえっと確か、ここをこうして……。", "zh": "不然这样好了，我们一起看看拍得怎么样吧。\n我记得，是这样操作吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0064_1007_p", "source_sha256": "eb2d4d93676dcd3401e2213310600d0a03a9ffb5810beb00d6b86a5413bccadf", "ja": "よし。途中からだけど、\nメインの料理シーンから再生するぞ？", "zh": "好，我就不从头开始，\n直接从主要的料理场景开始播放啰。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0064_1008_se", "source_sha256": "266cd67c963d9a9fe45947dd16154287c2311994b183ebb6f789035f510f57ef", "ja": "ポチッ", "zh": "（按下）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0064_1010_001har", "source_sha256": "c21213557062526f0b31e7e9a15404db953fe7dcfab82b8d35f9ec043ec2b701", "ja": "{$P$}さん……。\n私、やっぱり緊張してません？", "zh": "{$P$}先生……\n我看起来很紧张不是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0064_1011_p", "source_sha256": "ddb8fe9ef1c9eb1a19c1a7d66a53bb39b7de3a9267badf9ffb2e11f3a665000f", "ja": "そうか？　俺にはただ、春香が一生懸命に……。\nあ、そうか。緊張っていうのは、もしかして……。", "zh": "会吗？我只觉得春香很努力在……\n啊，我懂了。你说的紧张，该不会是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0064_1012_001har", "source_sha256": "f0235cba2eaf6858b0b607e83777dbaa5d79f38d9806e9262ca2321ac130bcd4", "ja": "えっ？　もしかして、って……？", "zh": "咦？该不会是什么……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0064_1013_se", "source_sha256": "fde6d9d85129cca12dff6da81dbc031856437130bead827262aee9bcdb59e611", "ja": "どんがらがっしゃーん", "zh": "（摔了一跤）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0064_1014_001har", "source_sha256": "2d3752e873357bb0bc04b6642e9d25820eaa91eb069bb0626e8e8f1d0453b2da", "ja": "わぁっ！　っ、{$P$}さん、\nここも撮ってたんですか！？", "zh": "哇！唔，{$P$}先生，\n连这部分也拍进去了吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0064_1015_001har", "source_sha256": "19123e671595342f66c4ce5546b33ccc54c0d91fdcb01115ddf0960441708b2a", "ja": "ああもう、私ったらバタバタして……。あ、それお塩！\nお砂糖は逆～！　うう、気づきませんでした……。", "zh": "真是的，看我手忙脚乱成这样……啊，那是盐巴！\n砂糖是另一个～！呜呜，我都没有发现……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0064_1016_001har", "source_sha256": "c267559e4aeaf0638f0bcb733185c1d3df188fb5b5cf37cc2d7678e1da386926", "ja": "{$P$}さん、私、緊張どころか\nいっぱい失敗しちゃってます……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，我何止是紧张，\n还搞砸了好多东西……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0064_1017_p", "source_sha256": "24dfcce033a0e971dd768508ec7abb57559827cd12697f3182eb77b14e999d58", "ja": "はは、そうみたいだな。\nでも、それだけ一生懸命ってことだよな。", "zh": "哈哈，看来是呢。\n不过，这也代表你有多么努力啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0064_1018_001har", "source_sha256": "58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a", "ja": "えっ？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0064_1019_p", "source_sha256": "8e1485485d8e48d8482c43134aa138c8dfe7b2ddc291960869093039b4cfe41c", "ja": "春香は緊張してたっていうより、\nきっと、料理に真剣だったんだ。", "zh": "与其说春香是在紧张，\n不如说是全神贯注在料理上才对。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0064_1020_p", "source_sha256": "6d60072cf7c48629733b92224cfd04c07053830a0dc7b9a3e3928532e219e348", "ja": "観てる俺達にとっては、それが一生懸命な女の子の、\nかわいい姿にしか映らない。だから良かったんだな。", "zh": "在我们旁观者眼中，只看到一名全力以赴的女孩子，\n她努力的可爱模样，所以才会觉得很棒。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0064_1021_001har", "source_sha256": "6978a5ddde9a655afc4989756abf5380178b15279e24195469d403492e773272", "ja": "そ、そんな……かわ……。\nも、もう、{$P$}さんってば～。", "zh": "居、居然说人家……可爱……\n讨、讨厌，{$P$}先生真是的～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0064_1022_p", "source_sha256": "1476d708fd43bbbb29514b4487d91ade41a6803483ed1ee98e9900df67bcfd35", "ja": "ま、当の本人は真剣なぶん、大変だろうけど。", "zh": "不过当事人是很认真在做菜，所以大概只觉得很慌乱。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0064_1023_001har", "source_sha256": "d09ed7e32f9f820dade3060e54b0bea368c22e1b1484b9dc183dfbf9f8fcbba2", "ja": "そ、そうですよ、大変なんですからねっ！\nでも……えへへ、頑張ります♪", "zh": "就、就是说啊，人家都要累倒了！\n不过……嘿嘿，我会加油的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0064_1024_p", "source_sha256": "810cfdd88d347c17e0fe6ce52fce02d58798a115b03e806ad70303fa3c5651ab", "ja": "ああ、おいしいのを期待してるぞ、春香！", "zh": "嗯，我很期待你的佳肴喔，春香！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0064_1025_001har", "source_sha256": "7de9fbee09dbc70e555d3ab9b59f9135e4a7770a885394d6f49096d299b330cd", "ja": "あ、はいっ。とりあえず、全力で味を直して……。\nうう、結局しょっぱかったら、ごめんなさいっ！", "zh": "啊，好的！总之，我先努力抢救味道……\n呜呜，如果还是很咸，那就对不起了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
